TITLE Pyrite oxidation via O2(g) using REACTION and EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
REACTION 1
    O2 1
    1.0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
END
